<Docs title="Standard library"><h1>Standard library</h1><p>EDL's standard library surface is not yet documented as a stable public API. The current examples rely on built-in operations such as <code>print</code> and string values.</p><p>As modules become available, this page will describe their contracts and compatibility guarantees. Until then, treat implementation details as experimental.</p></Docs>
